@best-practices.least-knowledge

Purpose:
  Minimize coupling between modules.

Also known as:
  Law of Demeter.

UseWhen:
  - designing module interfaces
  - reducing coupling
  - improving testability

Rule:
  Talk only to immediate friends.

Why:
  Reduces ripple effects of changes.

Related:
  @best-practices.solid
  @best-practices.composition-over-inheritance

Examples:
  @project.payment
  @project.order

State: +
